# Query with Dynamic Repo PoC

## Postgres

```elixir
credential = [
  hostname: "localhost",
  username: "postgres",
  password: "customer_db",
  port: 48141,
  database: "postgres"
]

query = """
SELECT 1;
"""

Carrier.Dynamic.PostgresRepo.with_dynamic_repo(credential, fn repo ->
  Ecto.Adapters.SQL.query!(repo, query)
end)
```
